# Cloudflare Pages — The Urban Physio
# Format: one rule per line — [source] [destination] [code]
# Multiline / _headers-style rules are IGNORED.
#
# DO NOT add "/* /index.html 200" here.
# Cloudflare Pages already SPA-falls back to / when no 404.html exists,
# AND still serves real files under /static/*. An explicit /* rewrite is
# ALWAYS applied (even when the .js exists) → browser gets HTML → 
# Uncaught SyntaxError: Unexpected token '<'.
#
# www → apex: set in Cloudflare Dashboard → Rules → Redirects (domain-level
# redirects are not supported in this file).
#
# /backend/api proxy: not supported here (external destinations cannot be
# proxied with 200). Frontend uses VITE_API_URL directly.

# Optional: keep build assets from being mistaken for routes (identity is a no-op;
# left empty on purpose — rely on CF static file serving + built-in SPA).
